  "description": "A modern, cross-platform C# port of Apache FOP (Formatting Objects Processor): read an XSL-FO document and render it to PDF, plain text, Markdown or HTML. This single package bundles the whole engine (FO tree, layout, area tree, PdfSharp and native PDF renderers, text renderers, fonts, SVG and hyphenation). Use the FopProcessor facade (FO in, PDF out).",
